# Crates whose job is D-Bus (see scripts/check-portable.sh). Each reaches zbus by design; the
# portable gate for quire is that they stay behind their crate boundary (check-boundary.sh), and
# that ds-desktop names zbus only under its `dbus` feature.
^\./crates/ds-settings/src/(live/|portal\.rs)
^\./crates/ds-helpers/src/
^\./crates/ds-blitz/src/(menus|print)
^\./crates/ds-desktop/src/
